constants.agent.CLASSIFIER_PROMPT:
Classify the effort this message requires from an assistant with tools. Reply with ONLY one of these words: low, medium, high.
low = greeting, small talk, a simple fact, a single quick lookup or calculation, or a request the assistant cannot do (set alarms, send messages, call someone);
medium = a web search, a short multi-step calculation, a normal explanation, ordinary code (a script, a query, a fix) or a plan or text written from the details given;
high = ONLY when the user asks for in-depth research or a comparison across several sources, or for a genuinely hard problem (a proof, a complex optimization, debugging a large program). A trip or study plan, ordinary code or anything the assistant cannot do is never high.

